; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M3: EMA trailing (TrailMode 7), setup 1 of 3: sell, session 0700-1200 server time, trend filter M15 EMA 50, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: stop beyond the EMA(8) of M3 closes, once the profit reaches 0.5R. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 7, TrailParam 8).
; Picked on 1 Jan 2025 - 15 May 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (FTMO spread, no commission; score 1.67): 75 trades, PF 1.88. Replay of the same months: 81 trades, PF 1.13.
; TICK REPLAY (every Dukascopy tick, the EA's rules; VT costs: VT's 0.15 spread scaled by Dukascopy's own spread, 0.60 USD commission per ounce). 16 May - 13 Nov 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 42 trades, PF 0.72, net -4.5R (stressed PF 0.69); the 3 setups of M3 + EMA together 125 trades, PF 0.98, net -1.2R (stressed 0.78).
; EMA trailing with its own setups was chosen as the best on M3 (highest PF of the EA's trailing systems with 100+ trades in those months; each system has its own setups), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test. Even so the set lost money in those months (PF 0.98): it is here only because the zip has the best system of every timeframe.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 26 trades, PF 0.43. The 3 setups together: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 86 trades, PF 0.62. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Needs a spread near VT's 0.15 USD: at Dukascopy's own wider spreads the 3 setups took 82 of the 125 trades in those months, PF 0.89.
; Data: Dukascopy XAUUSD ticks, broker server time. Commission is in the figures: set CommissionPerLot to your round-trip commission per lot.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
